  "description": "This adorable collection of 40 watercolor Christmas illustrations.\nFeaturing charming woodland animal bakers, gingerbread cottages, festive cookies, Christmas cakes and rustic baking accessories, this collection combines cozy holiday baking with a delightful vintage storybook aesthetic.\nWHAT’S INCLUDED\n40 Christmas-themed PNG illustrations\nGingerbread houses and festive cottage designs\nAdorable woodland animal characters\nTeddy bears, foxes, squirrels, mice and rabbits\nGingerbread cookies and holiday treats\nChristmas cakes and decorative desserts\nVintage baking utensils and kitchen accessories\nChristmas trees, wreaths and festive greenery\nGift boxes, cookie tins and rustic lanterns\nSeasonal decorative arrangements\nPERFECT FOR\nChristmas greeting cards and invitations\nHoliday scrapbooking and journaling\nChristmas gift tags and gift packaging\nPrintable holiday decorations\nBakery branding concepts and seasonal graphics\nChristmas party invitations\nDigital planners and stationery\nSublimation and personalized craft projects\nStickers and creative paper crafts\nWinter-themed illustrations and digital designs\nART STYLE\nPremium watercolor and gouache-inspired illustrations with warm gingerbread tones, cinnamon brown, cranberry red, forest green, soft cream and muted gold. The collection features charming woodland characters, delicate painted textures and a cozy vintage Christmas storybook atmosphere.\nFILE DETAILS\nQuantity: 40 illustrations\nFormat: PNG\nTheme: Christmas baking, gingerbread cottages and woodland animals\nIntended use: Digital crafting and graphic design projects\nPlease review the product preview and included files before purchasing. Actual image dimensions, transparency and resolution depend on the supplied files.",
